{"n": 408, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "408.webp", "text": "24-126\n\nTROUBLESHOOTING AUTOMATIC TRANSMISSION 4 HP 22/ EH\n\nRequirements for Troubleshooting:\n\na)\nb}\nce)\n\nEngine in good running condition (valves, DME and idle speed okay).\nDefect indicator, program indicator and position indicator okay,\nBattery, plugs and ground points okay.\n\nATF level okay.\n\nGeneral instructions to avoid damage on engine, transmission and control units.\n\na)\nb)\nc)\nd)\ne)\nf)\n\na)\n\nh)\n\nNever start the engine when the battery is not connected correctly.\nNever supply power to wrong poles (e.g. battery connections mixed up).\nNever use a fast charger to start the engine,\n\nDisconnect the battery prior to fast charging.\n\nNever disconnect the battery while the engine is running.\n\nOnly use a second 12 V battery and starting leads for outside starting.\n\nAlways turn off the ignition before disconnecting or connecting plugs on\ncontrol units.\n\nOnly high-ohmic testers (BMW SERVICE TESTER) may be used for testing\nwith 2 connected control unit.", "words": [["24-126", 0.4671, 0.0239, 0.541, 0.0477], ["TROUBLESHOOTING", 0.266, 0.0716, 0.3779, 0.0836], ["AUTOMATIC", 0.382, 0.0716, 0.4498, 0.0836], ["TRANSMISSION", 0.4534, 0.0716, 0.5375, 0.0836], ["4", 0.5415, 0.0729, 0.5471, 0.0836], ["HP", 0.5512, 0.0729, 0.5653, 0.0836], ["22/", 0.5689, 0.0729, 0.5881, 0.0836], ["EH", 0.5922, 0.0729, 0.6069, 0.0836], ["Requirements", 0.2655, 0.1379, 0.3333, 0.1512], ["for", 0.3369, 0.1379, 0.3506, 0.1485], ["Troubleshooting:", 0.3541, 0.1379, 0.4367, 0.1512], ["a)", 0.2649, 0.1711, 0.2736, 0.1824], ["b}", 0.2655, 0.2036, 0.2746, 0.2149], ["ce)", 0.2649, 0.2361, 0.2736, 0.248], ["Engine", 0.2847, 0.1704, 0.3176, 0.1837], ["in", 0.3212, 0.1737, 0.3303, 0.181], ["good", 0.3328, 0.1711, 0.3566, 0.1844], ["running", 0.3602, 0.1737, 0.3972, 0.1837], ["condition", 0.4002, 0.1711, 0.4463, 0.1817], ["(valves,", 0.4504, 0.1711, 0.4853, 0.1837], ["DME", 0.4889, 0.1711, 0.5122, 0.1824], ["and"